# Git Workflow Rules

## 🌿 Branch Naming (BẮT BUỘC)
```
<type>/<short-description>

feature/add-ai-generation
bugfix/fix-rabbitmq-connection
hotfix/critical-security-patch
refactor/extract-service
docs/update-readme
test/add-e2e
chore/update-deps
```

## 📝 Commit Format (Conventional Commits - BẮT BUỘC)
```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

### Types
- `feat` - Tính năng mới
- `fix` - Bug fix
- `docs` - Tài liệu
- `style` - Format code
- `refactor` - Refactor
- `perf` - Performance
- `test` - Thêm/sửa test
- `chore` - Build, deps
- `ci` - CI/CD
- `revert` - Revert

### Scope
`(ai)`, `(frontend)`, `(gateway)`, `(worker)`, `(rabbitmq)`, `(deps)`, `(ci)`

### Rules
- Subject ≤ 72 ký tự
- Imperative mood ("add" not "added")
- NO viết hoa chữ cái đầu
- NO dấu chấm cuối

## ✅ EXAMPLES
```bash
git commit -m "feat(ai): add Gemini API integration

Add Gemini AI to generate exam questions from content.
- Integrate Gemini API
- Add retry mechanism
- Handle quota limits"

git commit -m "fix(worker): correct message acknowledgment

Fix DLQ issue where messages were not properly acknowledged
after successful processing."
```

## ❌ NEVER
- `git commit -m "update"`
- `git commit -m "fix bug"`
- `git commit -m "WIP"`
- Commit trực tiếp vào main
